package.description:
Resource Monitoring Package Version 1.0.
Bundles wishing to use this package must list the package in the Import-Package header of the bundle's manifest. This package has two types of users: the consumers that use the API in this package and the providers that implement the API in this package.
Example import for consumers using the API in this package:
{@code Import-Package: org.osgi.service.resourcemonitoring; version="[1.0,2.0)"}
Example import for providers implementing the API in this package:
{@code Import-Package: org.osgi.service.resourcemonitoring; version="[1.0,1.1)"}

method.return:
the type of the event. One of:


{@link #RESOURCE_CONTEXT_CREATED}

{@link #RESOURCE_CONTEXT_REMOVED}

{@link #BUNDLE_ADDED}

{@link #BUNDLE_REMOVED}

method.description:
Returns the event type. The type values are:


{@link #NORMAL}

{@link #WARNING}

{@link #ERROR}

